B.bjy=new A.aZ("Distance Preference",B.ad_,'This setting determines if your Kennel will display distances in miles or kilometers.\n\nIt is probably best to keep this setting on the "Default for the Country" as Harrier Central will select the setting that is appropriate to the location you are in.')
B.bjz=new A.aZ("Run Tags",B.mg,"Select tags that describe this run.\n\nTags are organized into categories:\n\u2022 Theme (Normal run, Red Dress, Full Moon, etc.)\n\u2022 Restrictions (Men only, Women only, Kids allowed, etc.)\n\u2022 What to bring (Flashlight, Dry clothes, etc.)\n\u2022 Run Type (Pub crawl, Short trail, Long trail, etc.)\n\u2022 Terrain (Shiggy, City, Hills, etc.)\n\u2022 Hares (Live hare, Dead hare, etc.)\n\u2022 Other (On-After, Parking, etc.)")
